{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/1ab7d06bd5f790e1f5db.json":{"assets":{"ep5/quest_story_15201210":{"skip":{"source_cn":"初代梅林用魔法将你们传送到了精神之楔的领域。","text_i18n":{"cn":"初代梅林用魔法将你们传送到了精神之楔的领域。","en":"Merlin the First teleports you to the realm of the Wedge of Spirit.","jp":"初代マーリンの魔法で、精神の楔がある場所まで移動した。","kr":"초대 멀린이 우리를 마법으로 정신의 큐브의 영역으로 텔레포트 시켰다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["15201210"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["25191"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/c64c5e02fc4cb41f2bf8.json":{"assets":{"ep5/quest_story_15110100":{"skip":{"source_cn":"你选择了精神之楔。这或许是一场意志的考验。","text_i18n":{"cn":"你选择了精神之楔。这或许是一场意志的考验。","en":"You pick the Wedge of Spirit, expecting a test of your willpower.","jp":"あなたは精神の楔を選んだ。そこでは意志が試されることになるだろう。","kr":"아마도 의지를 시험하는 정신의 큐브를 선택했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["15110100"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["25175"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/e6b04cc57d92f96723aa.json":{"assets":{"ep5/quest_story_15201220":{"skip":{"source_cn":"精神之楔附近存在着烈焰吐息着，这说明精神之楔对应着火焰之力。","text_i18n":{"cn":"精神之楔附近存在着烈焰吐息着，这说明精神之楔对应着火焰之力。","en":"The breath of flame near the Wedge of Spirit suggests it's connected to the power of fire.","jp":"精神の楔の近くにはフレイムブリーザーがいる。この楔は炎の力を表しているようだ。","kr":"주변에는 정신의 큐브가 화염의 힘을 가지고 있다는 듯, 맹렬한 불길이 뿜어져 나오고 있었다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["15201220"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["25192"]}}}},"locales/cn/ep5/quest_story/15110100.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1511010001:0":{"text":"精神之楔会考验意志吗？","source_cn":"精神之楔会考验意志吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F97F0271648991D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511010002:0":{"